  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 713.05 Increased Monitoring for Secondaries after an Exceedance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 713.05 Increased Monitoring for Secondaries after an Exceedance. The O/O of a community water system or non-transient, non-community water system where an SMCL is exceeded and consumer complaints have been documented shall monitor based on a schedule established by the department in accordance with Env-Dw 708.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
